  "description": "New to the Market – Luxury 3 Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence\n37 Barr Na Trimoige, Kilkelly, Co. Mayo – F35 RX38\n\nGuide Price: €225,000\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this luxury 3-bedroom two-storey semi-detached residence, coming to the market in true showhouse condition throughout, ideally located on a quiet cul-de-sac development.\n\nThis property is fully decorated and finished to a high standard, offering bright, spacious accommodation and modern living in a highly convenient village location.\n\nEnjoy immediate access to Kilkelly Village, with schools, shops, church and all local amenities within walking distance, while also benefiting from excellent connectivity to Knock Airport, Knock Shrine and the N17 Galway–Sligo route.\n\nAccommodation Comprises:\nEntrance Hall:\nBright and spacious with vinyl flooring and wide entrance.\n\nSitting Room:\nFeature bay window, open fireplace with timber surround and granite hearth, creating a warm and inviting space.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area:\nModern layout with vinyl flooring in dining area, tiled kitchen floor, pine fitted units, tiled splashback and patio doors to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room:\nTiled floor, worktop, plumbed for appliances with PVC door to rear garden.\n\nGuest WC:\nTiled floor, WC and WHB.\nFirst Floor:\n\nLanding:\nSolid timber flooring, hotpress and access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 (Master Ensuite):\nSpacious double room with solid timber flooring, dual-aspect windows, ensuite with WC, WHB, mirror with shaver light and fully tiled walk-in electric shower.\n\nBedroom 2:\nSolid timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 3:\nSolid timber flooring with dual-aspect windows.\n\nMain Bathroom:\nWhite suite with fully tiled floor, tiled around bath and half tiled walls, mirror with shaver light.\n\nOutside & Grounds:\nTarmac driveway to front\nGarden to side and rear with panel fencing\nGarden shed included\nPrivate and secure setting\n\nKey Features:\nShowhouse condition throughout\n3-bedroom semi-detached residence\nLocated in a quiet cul-de-sac development\nWalking distance to Kilkelly Village amenities\nMains water and sewage connected\nExcellent connectivity to Knock Airport & N17 route\nFully decorated and ready for immediate occupation\nIdeal family home or first-time buyer opportunity\n\nThis is a turnkey property in a prime location, offering quality, convenience and excellent value.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\n\nSole Agent: Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\nMIPAV MMCEPI\nPSRA Licence No: 002031\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details.",
